OL,3,GNEWSACivilian drone project to help
OL,4,Afight rural crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drone project working to prevent
OL,7,Frural crime has been launched in
OL,8,FHampshire.
OL,10,FCivilian volunteers will be able to be
OL,11,Fdeployed by officers to incidents using
OL,12,Fthe GoodSAM app, with video footage
OL,13,Ffrom their drones accessible in real
OL,14,Ftime by the control room using
OL,15,FStarlink.
OL,17,FThe project is believed to be the
OL,18,F"first of its kind" in the country and,
OL,19,Fif successful, it is hoped it could be
OL,20,Frolled out nationally.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
